{
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "多线程、可断点续传的 HTTP/HTTPS 文件下载器 + 视频源下载（CLI + 深色 GUI）",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/xgzzz/BearDown",
    "license": "MIT",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/xgzzz/BearDown/releases/download/v0.1.0/BearDown-0.1.0-x64.zip",
            "hash": "f190065d58e1a2b4155cfa26a606bd3ed04d6d9ed8e3eb954b81c9e0776c5636"
        }
    },
    "bin": [
        [
            "beardown-cli.exe",
            "beardown"
        ]
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "beardown-gui.exe",
            "BearDown"
        ]
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "$exe = Join-Path $dir 'beardown-gui.exe'",
        "if (Test-Path $exe) { $lnk = Join-Path ([Environment]::GetFolderPath('Desktop')) 'BearDown.lnk'; $ws = New-Object -ComObject WScript.Shell; $sc = $ws.CreateShortcut($lnk); $sc.TargetPath = $exe; $sc.WorkingDirectory = $dir; $sc.Save() }"
    ],
    "pre_uninstall": [
        "Remove-Item (Join-Path ([Environment]::GetFolderPath('Desktop')) 'BearDown.lnk') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "beardown       CLI 入口：add / list / resume / verify / rm（分块下载、断点续传、多源镜像）",
        "BearDown(桌面) 深色 GUI，双击无控制台窗口；视频任务支持暂停/取消",
        "视频源下载需另装 yt-dlp：scoop install yt-dlp（或 pip install yt-dlp）",
        "任务数据库：%USERPROFILE%\\.beardown\\beardown.db",
        "代理：自动读取 Windows 系统代理；可设 HTTPS_PROXY 环境变量显式覆盖"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/xgzzz/BearDown"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/xgzzz/BearDown/releases/download/v$version/BearDown-$version-x64.zip"
            }
        },
        "hash": {
            "url": "$url.sha256"
        }
    }
}
